96422", "id": "17967088271984297", "text": "next", "timestamp": 1793635339, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "shashi43819", "author_id": "78150904031", "id": "18134860447800856", "text": "😢😢😢", "timestamp": 1793625507, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "patelakanksha86", "author_id": "54872449947", "id": "18182705890426872", "text": "😢", "timestamp": 1792927944, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "chinnitrupti", "author_id": "8399433841", "id": "18078882575468480", "text": "😢😢", "timestamp": 1792899216, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tina_maheswari123", "author_id": "72496438856", "id": "17912885367473677", "text": "Aisi jindagi duniya mein bahut bujurg Hain Jo akele gujarte Hain Jo ghar ke bacche apni Masti mein khane kamane mein nikal jaate Hain sabke Liye rupaye paise waqt hota hai lekin bujurgon ke liye Nahin hota Jaise aaj ka jamana social Media ka hai to kafi kuchh Ghar baithe ham log dekhne dekh sakte hain pata chalta Hai duniya mein Kitna dukh hai jab bola Dhokha De De to bujurgon ko hi ek dusre ka Sahara Banna chahie padosi padosi duniya mein kaisi reet chalao ki Kisi ka man dukhi Na Rahe vaise to log Jale per Namak chhidakne Wale Hain shayad hi Koi Kisi ko support Karen aur Vishwas bhi nahin kar sakte aaj ke time mein Jaise ki duniya mein Dhokha dhadi bahut ho rahi hai", "timestamp": 1792855497, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "s_s_a_d_y307", "author_id": "64297848316", "id": "17874279039637590", "text": "😢😢😢", "timestamp": 1792837515, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdwABUckmxb/", "webpage_url_basename": "DdwABUckmxb", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/825326463_18106899077065585_3524761537501985627_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=Mzk5NDY5Mjk2MDE1MTMwMTIxMTE4MTA2ODk5MDc0MDY1NTg1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZG